WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.984 --> 00:00:14.376
Hanbok is traditional clothing that highlights our own graceful curves, while glasses are a modern Western accessory, so they can feel out of place together.

2
00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:23.448
So the best approach is to choose rimless or thin metal frames so the glasses don't stand out too much.

3
00:00:23.784 --> 00:00:32.568
Thick or dark frames pull guests' attention to the glasses instead of your warm, kind eyes.

4
00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:39.192
The biggest worry with wearing glasses is that they hide the eye makeup,

5
00:00:39.528 --> 00:00:50.472
but fine, natural-looking false lashes that won't touch the lenses can still make your eyes look vivid even behind glasses.

6
00:00:50.808 --> 00:00:55.128
If you decide to go without glasses on the day,

7
00:00:55.464 --> 00:01:05.352
start going without them at least two to three days ahead so the nose pads don't leave deep marks, allowing for smooth-looking skin.

8
00:01:05.688 --> 00:01:13.680
The wisest way to decide is simply whether you can clearly recognize guests' faces while standing in the lobby.
